# =============================================================================
# Repo slimmed to the CANONICAL K5 QPSK Jupiter modem design. Everything at repo
# root is IGNORED except the keepers whitelisted below; the ~150 experimental
# snapshot dirs (composite_*, V*, fec_*, zed_*, jupiter_t8*, rf_*, ...) remain on
# LOCAL DISK, untracked -- they are NOT in the repo. Re-add one with:
#     git add -f <path>
# =============================================================================

# ---- ignore all root entries, then whitelist the canonical keepers ----
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/build_env_jupiter.sh
!/2026-07-01-bidir-240k-k5-design.md
!/docs/
!/docs_session/
!/host_app_k5/
!/jupiter_240k5_byte/
!/k5_240/
!/plans/
!/two_jup/

# ---- build/derived artifacts INSIDE the kept dirs. These come AFTER the
#      whitelist re-includes so they win (last matching pattern decides). ----
*.iq
*.mat
# golden payload is load-bearing (loaded by the build gates) -- keep despite *.mat
!/k5_240/golden_k5.mat
*.log
*.out
*.jou
*.pyc
*.vvp
*.vvpout
*.autosave
*BOOT.BIN
*BOOT.BIN.save
hdl_prj_*/
slprj/
obj_*/
.Xil/
ipcore/
s1_rtl/
__pycache__/
docs/superpowers/
two_jup/phaseB_agc/
jupiter_240k5_byte/rtl_sim/*.txt
jupiter_240k5_byte/rtl_sim/*.csv
jupiter_240k5_byte/rtl_sim/diag/
jupiter_240k5_byte/rtl_sim/replay/
two_jup/hunt/
two_jup/paired/
two_jup/census/
host_app_k5/qpsk_tun
host_app_k5/qpsk_capture
host_app_k5/qpsk_ringwrite
host_app_k5/test_frame
host_app_k5/test_k5
host_app_k5/test_ber
host_app_k5/test_whiten
host_app_k5/test_seq
